<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following companies are ex-dividend today, according to the Australian Stock Exchange:</p>
<p>    Asia Pacific	   3.50 cents</p>
<p>    Carlton Investments 37.00 cents</p>
<p>    Champion compressors 4.50 cents</p>
<p>    F.H. Faulding	  9.00 cents</p>
<p>    Fernz Corporation    9.41 cents</p>
<p>    Futuris Corporation  3.00 cents</p>
<p>    Gowing Bros	    7.00 cents</p>
<p>    HIH Winterthur	 7.00 cents</p>
<p>    Oil Co of Australia  3.00 cents</p>
<p>    Pacific Magazines   10.00 cents</p>
<p>    Sabre Group	    3.00 cents</p>
<p>    Simeon Wines	  15.50 cents</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
